  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Womens participation and leadership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.Gender-based violence is reduced following the application of the new register of norms of positive masculinity.2.Human rights defenders use monitoring and alert mechanisms to protect women&apos;s rights.3.Community members organize dialogues on norms promoting or subjugating women and men.4.Religious leaders preach a holistic gospel that works for social change and promotes equity and equality for women and men.5.Women and girls participate in the peace and empowerment process decisions in households, schools and in civil society structures and peace initiatives in their communities.6.Panzi Foundation staff and partners have improved knowledge on gender analysis to design gender sensitive interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
